    "en": {
      "title": "Montocryl",
      "h1": "Mapei Montocryl",
      "description": "Montocryl is a two-component, fast-curing mounting mortar based on methyl methacrylate (PMMA) for anchoring bolts and reinforcing bars in rock and concrete and for fixing concrete elements.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Mapei logotyp",
          "href": "/produkter/mapei",
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 493,
          "src": "/assets/img/mapei-1.webp",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Mapei Montocryl",
          "src": "/assets/img/mapei-montocryl-main.webp",
          "width": 508,
          "height": 830,
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "BASTA: Montocryl is registered in BASTA",
          "href": "https://www.bastaonline.se/foretag/206-mapei-ab/artiklar/736738-montocryl-comp-b",
          "width": 960,
          "height": 546,
          "src": "/assets/img/mapei-basta-montocryl-en.webp",
          "maxWidth": 250,
          "caption": "Click to see the registration at BASTA",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Montocryl is a two-component, fast-curing mounting mortar based on methyl methacrylate (PMMA) for anchoring bolts and reinforcing bars in rock and concrete and for fixing concrete elements. It also works at low temperatures, down to -15 °C, and can be used as a repair mortar on horizontal concrete surfaces and for grouting under small foundations.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Cures fast, even at -15 °C",
            "High strength: compressive strength 80 N/mm² after 1 hour (+20 °C)",
            "Anchoring of bolts and reinforcing bars in rock and concrete",
            "Fixing of concrete elements, cast-in sleeves and core-drilled holes",
            "Complies with EN 1504-6",
            "Montocryl Comp. B is registered in BASTA"
          ],
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "stat",
          "label": "Consumption",
          "value": "2.3 kg/l",
          "unit": "of mixed mortar",
          "meta": "for grouting",
          "note": "For bolt anchoring the consumption depends on the hole and bolt diameters and the anchoring depth, see the table below.",
          "usage": true,
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "kind": "download",
          "text": "Technical data sheet (TDS)",
          "href": "/assets/docs/mapei-montocryl-tekniskt-datablad.pdf",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "kind": "download",
          "text": "Safety data sheet (SDS)",
          "href": "/assets/docs/mapei-montocryl-sakerhetsdatablad.pdf",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "kind": "download",
          "text": "Declaration of performance (DoP)",
          "href": "/assets/docs/mapei-montocryl-prestandadeklaration.pdf",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Areas of use",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Anchoring of bolts and reinforcing bars in rock and concrete",
            "Fixing of concrete elements: cast-in sleeves and core-drilled holes",
            "Grouting under small foundations that need a high-strength, fast-curing mortar",
            "Repair mortar on horizontal concrete surfaces"
          ],
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Application",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "The concrete or stone must be clean and dry, free of dust, oil and other contaminants. Air and substrate must be warmer than -15 °C",
            "Pour component A into component B and mix with a slow-speed drill and paddle for at least 3 minutes. Do not dilute the product. Pot life about 10 minutes",
            "For bolt anchoring: drill the hole at least 10 mm larger than the bolt diameter, clean the hole and pour in Montocryl, e.g. with a funnel. Press the bolt into place and fix it until the mortar has cured"
          ],
          "gen": true
        },
